WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.339 --> 00:00:04.428
- I remember nine years
ago, when I started AliPay.

00:00:04.428 --> 00:00:07.041
People said, "Jack, don't
touch the financing sector

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:09.280
"'cause it's illegal,
you maybe imprisoned."

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.565
I call myself like a blind man riding

00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:14.697
on the back of the blind tigers.

00:00:14.697 --> 00:00:18.558
Those experts riding horses,
they all fell, we survive.

00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:21.203
We have a lot of heroes
but China movies' heroes

00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:22.660
always dead.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:24.442
The American movie hero never die.

00:00:24.442 --> 00:00:25.908
(audience laughing)

00:00:25.908 --> 00:00:29.703
If all the heroes die,
who want to be the hero?

00:00:29.703 --> 00:00:31.438
- He's a Chinese business magnate,

00:00:31.438 --> 00:00:33.364
who's the founder of Alibaba.

00:00:33.364 --> 00:00:35.575
He's the first mainland
Chinese entrepreneur

00:00:35.575 --> 00:00:37.488
to appear on the cover of Forbes.

00:00:37.488 --> 00:00:40.454
After graduation, he applied
for 30 different jobs,

00:00:40.454 --> 00:00:42.156
got rejected by all of them

00:00:42.156 --> 00:00:45.801
and also got rejected by
Harvard University 10 times.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:47.625
He's Jack Ma, and here's my take

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:50.909
on his top 10 rules to success volume two.

00:00:50.909 --> 00:00:53.479
And as always guys, if you
hear a message that Jack has,

00:00:53.479 --> 00:00:54.774
that it really resonates with you;

00:00:54.774 --> 00:00:56.423
please leave it in the comments below.

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.990
Put quotes around it so other people

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:59.477
can be inspired as well.

00:00:59.477 --> 00:01:00.310
Enjoy.

00:02:18.896 --> 00:02:23.171
- We are not a company
that normally China call.

00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:26.116
We call ourselves a
company running a platform.

00:02:26.116 --> 00:02:29.956
A company that is running an ecosystem.

00:02:29.956 --> 00:02:31.191
We are almost everywhere.

00:02:31.191 --> 00:02:35.426
People say, "Jack, you know
you're in the B2B, B2C,

00:02:35.426 --> 00:02:38.552
"and you're calling C2B on a
finance and online payment,

00:02:38.552 --> 00:02:42.069
"logistic, cloud computing,
you are everywhere."

00:02:42.069 --> 00:02:43.181
Not because we are greedy.

00:02:43.181 --> 00:02:44.493
Not because we wanted to win.

00:02:44.493 --> 00:02:45.723
Because we have to do it.

00:02:45.723 --> 00:02:47.718
If we cannot, if we do not do it,

00:02:47.718 --> 00:02:51.704
China e-commerce in the
years will collapse.

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:55.756
I remember nine years ago,
when I started Alipay.

00:02:55.756 --> 00:02:58.368
People say, "Jack, don't
touch the financing sector

00:02:58.368 --> 00:03:01.868
"'cause it's illegal, you may imprisoned."

00:03:03.791 --> 00:03:07.340
And I, we thought to
ourselves, if we don't do it,

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:11.639
the China e-commerce will
always like a check room.

00:03:11.639 --> 00:03:13.261
Everybody say it's a good thing.

00:03:13.261 --> 00:03:15.457
"I don't pay, you don't get the things."

00:03:15.457 --> 00:03:17.682
So I say, "Well, put me in the prison.

00:03:17.682 --> 00:03:19.965
"Let's make sure that Alipay,

00:03:19.965 --> 00:03:21.847
"the payment solution works."

00:03:21.847 --> 00:03:23.582
And the people said the payment solution

00:03:23.582 --> 00:03:25.059
is such a stupid idea.

00:03:25.059 --> 00:03:26.780
It's an escort service.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.447
I pay you all the money
and you get the things.

00:03:29.447 --> 00:03:30.280
You pay the money.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.636
If you don't get the things
you want, return the money.

00:03:32.636 --> 00:03:34.984
They said the stupid product

00:03:34.984 --> 00:03:38.044
and I say, "As long as it
has solved the problem,

00:03:38.044 --> 00:03:40.107
"I like stupid things, you know."

00:03:40.107 --> 00:03:42.149
Let's make stupid things smart.

00:03:42.149 --> 00:03:44.115
Keep on improving everyday.

00:03:44.115 --> 00:03:45.987
When I start the business,

00:03:45.987 --> 00:03:47.404
it's so difficult

00:03:48.826 --> 00:03:51.783
to me, a small business owner in China.

00:03:51.783 --> 00:03:54.783
It took me five months to earn $500.

00:03:55.709 --> 00:03:57.403
That's stupid.

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.236
No chance.

00:04:01.252 --> 00:04:04.273
I have no any idea about
how to run a business.

00:04:04.273 --> 00:04:08.288
And when I go to register
company called internet,

00:04:08.288 --> 00:04:10.597
the registering officer
said, "No, there's no such

00:04:10.597 --> 00:04:11.864
"a word Internet in dictionary.

00:04:11.864 --> 00:04:13.973
"How can you register an internet?"

00:04:13.973 --> 00:04:15.955
So he say, "You have to
register another name."

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:17.886
I said, "What's the name?"

00:04:17.886 --> 00:04:20.640
He said, "Computer consulting firm."

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:23.558
And I have no idea what is computer.

00:04:23.558 --> 00:04:26.827
So my first company is Hangzhou Hope

00:04:26.827 --> 00:04:28.910
Computer Consulting Firm.

00:04:30.528 --> 00:04:33.770
It was tough without knowing
anything about technology,

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.575
without knowing anything about a computer.

00:04:36.575 --> 00:04:39.448
The past 15 years, we're working.

00:04:39.448 --> 00:04:41.407
I call myself like a blind man

00:04:41.407 --> 00:04:43.217
riding on the back of blind tigers.

00:04:43.217 --> 00:04:44.923
(audience laughing)

00:04:44.923 --> 00:04:48.307
Those experts riding
horses, they all fell.

00:04:48.307 --> 00:04:51.125
We survive because we
worry about the future.

00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:52.406
We believe the future.

00:04:52.406 --> 00:04:55.306
We change ourselves, we never complete us.

00:04:55.306 --> 00:04:59.279
Every five years, we have
a review for our strategy.

00:04:59.279 --> 00:05:01.640
Our strategy is always
to look at the 30 years

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.487
and 10 years.

00:05:03.487 --> 00:05:06.520
Every strategic decisions we make,

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:09.203
we have to ask one question.

00:05:09.203 --> 00:05:13.183
This decision we make
solve society problem?

00:05:13.183 --> 00:05:16.699
Because we believe the bigger
social problem you solve,

00:05:16.699 --> 00:05:18.610
the more successful you are.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:21.809
So if we do, if this cannot
solve any social problems,

00:05:21.809 --> 00:05:22.800
we dont' do it.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:27.721
Second, is this project going
to be successful in 10 years?

00:05:27.721 --> 00:05:31.427
If it's going to be successful
in 10 years, let's do it.

00:05:31.427 --> 00:05:35.723
If it's going to be successful
in one year or one month,

00:05:35.723 --> 00:05:38.332
now would I say, "Forget about it."

00:05:38.332 --> 00:05:42.394
Because why you can be successful
in one year or one month?

00:05:42.394 --> 00:05:44.200
So we all have to prepare.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:47.998
And five years ago, we
had a big debate about

00:05:47.998 --> 00:05:49.627
10 years later, 20 years,

00:05:49.627 --> 00:05:51.970
what are the things does China society,

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:53.854
that want to live, want?

00:05:53.854 --> 00:05:56.663
So we say, happiness and health.

00:05:56.663 --> 00:05:59.914
Two H strategy to happiness and health.

00:05:59.914 --> 00:06:04.081
We believe, in the movie
industry bring people happiness.

00:06:05.486 --> 00:06:06.577
Today, nobody's happy.

00:06:06.577 --> 00:06:09.692
Rich people not happy,
poor people not happy.

00:06:09.692 --> 00:06:13.022
At least when I watch movie,
I feel happy about it, right?

00:06:13.022 --> 00:06:16.368
So I think we should
partner with the Hollywood,

00:06:16.368 --> 00:06:19.241
especially like a lot of,

00:06:19.241 --> 00:06:21.308
we have a different way of living.

00:06:21.308 --> 00:06:22.975
In China, the movie.

00:06:23.828 --> 00:06:25.135
We have a lot of heroes.

00:06:25.135 --> 00:06:27.638
But China movies' heroes always dead.

00:06:27.638 --> 00:06:31.136
And American movie hero never die.

00:06:31.136 --> 00:06:35.524
If all the heroes die,
who want to be the hero?

00:06:35.524 --> 00:06:39.405
So my movie, I want to make the hero live.

00:06:39.405 --> 00:06:42.150
This is, I think, we should learn a lot;

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:44.430
and it's only about two years.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:46.521
So we have another eight years to go.

00:06:46.521 --> 00:06:48.771
I want to make our company,

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.596
it's not e-commerce.

00:06:53.596 --> 00:06:57.141
It's something that
giving people inspiration.

00:06:57.141 --> 00:06:59.634
Giving people 'cause I learned a lot.

00:06:59.634 --> 00:07:02.646
For example, I will see
that my favorite movie,

00:07:02.646 --> 00:07:03.729
Forrest Gump.

00:07:05.402 --> 00:07:06.485
Life's tough.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:10.672
This is I learned and that inspired me.

00:07:10.672 --> 00:07:13.766
That is why when people
call me crazy, stupid,

00:07:13.766 --> 00:07:15.494
the past 17 years, "You are crazy.

00:07:15.494 --> 00:07:16.939
"I told you something that won't work.

00:07:16.939 --> 00:07:18.883
"You're stupid, how can you do that model?

00:07:18.883 --> 00:07:20.929
"Amazon this model, eBay this model,

00:07:20.929 --> 00:07:23.018
"Why Alibaba this model?"

00:07:23.018 --> 00:07:26.298
I told myself Forrest
Gump said, "Go ahead.

00:07:26.298 --> 00:07:28.096
"Never care about what the other people."

00:07:28.096 --> 00:07:30.113
And the other thing Forrest Gump said,

00:07:30.113 --> 00:07:33.115
"Nobody make money out of catching whales.

00:07:33.115 --> 00:07:36.808
"People make money by catching shrimps."

00:07:36.808 --> 00:07:39.236
So, we serve small business.

00:07:39.236 --> 00:07:41.569
- [Interviewer] Fair enough.

00:08:46.586 --> 00:08:48.739
- Who works harder, the people at eBay

00:08:48.739 --> 00:08:50.822
or the people at Alibaba?

00:08:53.443 --> 00:08:55.729
- It's sometimes you have
not only have to work hard,

00:08:55.729 --> 00:08:57.646
you have to work smart.

00:08:59.012 --> 00:09:00.900
- So would you say you
work smarter than eBay?

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.076
You'd have to say yes, right?

00:09:02.076 --> 00:09:03.526
Well, so far.
- Yeah, so far.

00:09:03.526 --> 00:09:05.124
So far.
- Okay.

00:09:05.124 --> 00:09:07.374
- 'Cause I think, you know,

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:12.105
we are pretty lucky people
and the people see you,

00:09:12.105 --> 00:09:13.344
"Yeah, you work very hard."

00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:16.810
True, in this world, so
many people work very hard

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:17.810
but they're not.

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:20.143
I told my team, when we IPO,

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.484
I asked a lot of people sitting there,

00:09:22.484 --> 00:09:24.942
I say, "You know, all of
you guys, most of you got

00:09:24.942 --> 00:09:27.723
"millionaires and so rich;

00:09:27.723 --> 00:09:30.223
but 15 years ago, who are we?"

00:09:31.899 --> 00:09:35.310
It's so difficult for us to
hire people 15 years ago.

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:37.643
People who are not that bad.

00:09:38.615 --> 00:09:42.083
People can walk, still walk
on the street, we hire them.

00:09:42.083 --> 00:09:43.389
Because no one believed Internet.

00:09:43.389 --> 00:09:44.864
No one believed Internet.

00:09:44.864 --> 00:09:46.435
And they joined the company.

00:09:46.435 --> 00:09:48.493
Those people who believed they were smart,

00:09:48.493 --> 00:09:50.555
they were headhunted by the other company.

00:09:50.555 --> 00:09:51.980
They set up their own company.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.881
Those people, nobody
go to headhunting them.

00:09:54.881 --> 00:09:58.021
They stay until they became successful.

00:09:58.021 --> 00:10:01.337
They are the key reasons
we exist, we persist,

00:10:01.337 --> 00:10:02.337
we never give up.

00:10:02.337 --> 00:10:03.994
We believe the dreams together.

00:10:03.994 --> 00:10:06.121
- One of the things that's
so fascinating to me,

00:10:06.121 --> 00:10:09.106
is that Amazon and Jeff Besos
have pursued what might be

00:10:09.106 --> 00:10:11.999
described as a very asset
heavy business model.

00:10:11.999 --> 00:10:13.527
They're buying airplanes.

00:10:13.527 --> 00:10:15.582
They want to own the entire supply chain

00:10:15.582 --> 00:10:16.920
from beginning to end.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.836
And Alibaba has effectively
an asset-like business.

00:10:19.836 --> 00:10:21.794
It is very much in terms of the retail

00:10:21.794 --> 00:10:23.460
piece of this, the opposite.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:24.808
You don't want to own the warehouses.

00:10:24.808 --> 00:10:27.841
You don't want to own
the logistics companies.

00:10:27.841 --> 00:10:29.648
How do you think about that?

00:10:29.648 --> 00:10:31.538
Is Jeff Besos right? Or are you right?

00:10:31.538 --> 00:10:35.168
And is there going to be
a meeting in the middle?

00:10:35.168 --> 00:10:37.168
- I hope both are right.

00:10:38.277 --> 00:10:41.168
And because the world can
never have a one model.

00:10:41.168 --> 00:10:43.622
If the world has only one correct model,

00:10:43.622 --> 00:10:45.659
the world's too boring.

00:10:45.659 --> 00:10:47.851
We need to have our own kinds of models

00:10:47.851 --> 00:10:49.901
and the people who do the model,

00:10:49.901 --> 00:10:51.394
should believe in the model.

00:10:51.394 --> 00:10:53.644
And I believe in what I do.

00:10:54.483 --> 00:10:56.795
The difference between Amazon and us,

00:10:56.795 --> 00:10:59.350
Amazon is more like an empire.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.860
Everything they should control
themselves, buy and sell.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:06.593
And our philosophy is that
we want to be an ecosystem.

00:11:06.593 --> 00:11:10.117
Our philosophy is to empower others

00:11:10.117 --> 00:11:11.397
to sell,

00:11:11.397 --> 00:11:13.564
empower others to service,

00:11:14.416 --> 00:11:17.786
making sure the other people
are more powerful than us.

00:11:17.786 --> 00:11:20.967
Making sure with our
technology, our innovation;

00:11:20.967 --> 00:11:24.506
our partners, our 10 million
small business sellers,

00:11:24.506 --> 00:11:27.988
they can compete with Microsoft IBM.

00:11:27.988 --> 00:11:32.309
Our philosophy is that we think
using Internet technology,

00:11:32.309 --> 00:11:34.617
we can make every company become Amazon.

00:11:34.617 --> 00:11:38.797
I learned my English by myself
when I was 12 years old.

00:11:38.797 --> 00:11:40.127
For whatever reason, I don't know.

00:11:40.127 --> 00:11:42.568
I just fell in love with the language.

00:11:42.568 --> 00:11:46.336
Every morning, from five
o'clock, I rode a bicycle,

00:11:46.336 --> 00:11:50.459
aboout 40 minutes to the Hangzhou Hotel,

00:11:50.459 --> 00:11:52.820
looking for foreign tourists
to teach me English.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.846
I toured, showed them around the city,

00:11:54.846 --> 00:11:56.701
they taught me English.

00:11:56.701 --> 00:11:59.782
My English is not perfect
but the things I learned

00:11:59.782 --> 00:12:03.420
so interesting because
the things the Americans,

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:06.448
the foreign tourists there
in China, they told me

00:12:06.448 --> 00:12:07.930
are so different from the things

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:10.889
I learned from my parents and my teachers.

00:12:10.889 --> 00:12:13.730
(audience laughing)

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.901
I was in the cultural revolution.

00:12:15.901 --> 00:12:18.523
Everything I thought so different.

00:12:18.523 --> 00:12:22.270
Since then, everything I
learned, I've got to habit.

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:24.720
You have to think yourself
break to think about it.

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.343
Just one more minute.

00:12:26.343 --> 00:12:29.856
When everything points to
yes, wait for one minute.

00:12:29.856 --> 00:12:32.316
Whenever it's a no, wait for one minute.

00:12:32.316 --> 00:12:33.764
Think about it carefully.

00:12:33.764 --> 00:12:37.808
'Cause if you look at the
world in a different way,

00:12:37.808 --> 00:12:39.467
you might win a different way.

00:12:39.467 --> 00:12:42.597
- In the future, you will not make money

00:12:42.597 --> 00:12:47.312
by the service you offer,
how good service you do.

00:12:47.312 --> 00:12:50.562
It's going to be how efficient you are.

00:12:52.752 --> 00:12:57.090
Alibaba, we are company,
right now, have 20.

00:12:57.090 --> 00:13:00.451
That's not including the financial group.

00:13:00.451 --> 00:13:01.409
We have 25 units,

00:13:01.409 --> 00:13:03.252
We have 25 units,

00:13:03.252 --> 00:13:05.862
25 different business units.

00:13:05.862 --> 00:13:07.754
Maybe in the future, we might have 50.

00:13:07.754 --> 00:13:09.240
I don't know.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:13.697
We have that many units and
we are almost everywhere.

00:13:13.697 --> 00:13:17.498
We control our head counts
by efficiency we have.

00:13:17.498 --> 00:13:20.062
We only have our 224,000 people.

00:13:20.062 --> 00:13:22.013
We only have our 224,000 people.

00:13:22.013 --> 00:13:23.596
I tell you a story.

00:13:24.437 --> 00:13:26.663
The thing I feel proud
of, that two years ago,

00:13:26.663 --> 00:13:29.528
we start to have a budgeting meeting

00:13:29.528 --> 00:13:30.805
and

00:13:30.805 --> 00:13:32.086
I ask my team,

00:13:32.086 --> 00:13:35.513
"By year 2012, if we really
want to double all the numbers

00:13:35.513 --> 00:13:38.100
"we have, how many people we need?"

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:40.767
And people say 7,800 new people.

00:13:42.087 --> 00:13:44.172
I said, "No, no, no, check it again."

00:13:44.172 --> 00:13:46.604
And then they said, "600,800 people."

00:13:46.604 --> 00:13:47.945
I said, "No."

00:13:47.945 --> 00:13:51.604
And they, my people ask
me, "How many you want?"

00:13:51.604 --> 00:13:53.184
I said, "200."

00:13:53.184 --> 00:13:55.934
They said, "No, impossible, 200."

00:13:57.623 --> 00:14:00.212
My answer is for years

00:14:00.212 --> 00:14:03.212
we discussed we should hire
more people for future.

00:14:03.212 --> 00:14:05.458
I've heard this for 10 years.

00:14:05.458 --> 00:14:08.708
Now, let's just do the efficient thing.

00:14:09.577 --> 00:14:12.232
And I told all the management,

00:14:12.232 --> 00:14:14.209
if we have net income--

00:14:14.209 --> 00:14:17.792
net headcount of over
200, even one people,

00:14:19.371 --> 00:14:23.448
we should have no bonus for
whole year, for year 2012.

00:14:23.448 --> 00:14:25.865
And then we started the plan.

00:14:26.946 --> 00:14:27.779
Year 2012,

00:14:28.835 --> 00:14:30.143
we let loose

00:14:30.143 --> 00:14:31.442
1,000 people.

00:14:31.442 --> 00:14:33.133
All the number doubled.

00:14:33.133 --> 00:14:37.374
And I say, if we want to create
more jobs for the others,

00:14:37.374 --> 00:14:39.340
let's keep our head counts.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:43.575
Make sure because right now,
we have over 500 million

00:14:43.575 --> 00:14:45.818
registered users on top of.

00:14:45.818 --> 00:14:48.465
No matter how many
people we hire ourselves,

00:14:48.465 --> 00:14:51.715
we cannot be, always not enough people.

00:14:52.598 --> 00:14:55.710
So we can focus on technology,

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.863
focusing on making sure
the platform is efficient,

00:14:58.863 --> 00:15:02.216
focusing on everybody make the
difference in the platform.

00:15:02.216 --> 00:15:03.671
That would make the difference.

00:15:03.671 --> 00:15:07.568
People say this is
uncertain, uncertain world.

00:15:07.568 --> 00:15:09.094
Everyday is uncertain.

00:15:09.094 --> 00:15:12.467
The only certain day was yesterday.

00:15:12.467 --> 00:15:15.046
I'm not sure about that in the future,

00:15:15.046 --> 00:15:17.827
I can, I will dictate, I will be stupid.

00:15:17.827 --> 00:15:21.615
That's why I should retire
early when I'm young.

00:15:21.615 --> 00:15:23.073
That is why I've a lot of things

00:15:23.073 --> 00:15:24.263
that I dream I want to do.

00:15:24.263 --> 00:15:26.076
I want to do philanthropy,
I want to be a teacher,

00:15:26.076 --> 00:15:29.640
I want to go back to school,
I want to do the environment.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:32.235
The world is so wonderful,
why should you be the CEO

00:15:32.235 --> 00:15:34.720
of Alibaba all the time?

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:37.973
I come into this world not to work.

00:15:37.973 --> 00:15:40.118
I want to come to this
world to enjoy my life.

00:15:40.118 --> 00:15:41.473
I don't want to die in my office.

00:15:41.473 --> 00:15:42.934
I want to die on the beaches.

00:15:42.934 --> 00:15:44.031
(audience laughing)

00:15:44.031 --> 00:15:45.666
- It's a wonderful message.

00:15:45.666 --> 00:15:47.155
